From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:11:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] lib: know the frame-sequential stereo layout

The kernel's frame-sequential stereo series adds
DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_SEQUENTIAL: the framebuffer holds both eyes side
by side, left eye first, each the size of the mode, and the driver sends
one eye per frame of the mode, naming it to the sink. A stereo
framebuffer for such a mode hit igt_create_stereo_fb()'s assertion on
unknown layouts, and kmstest_dump_mode() printed no layout for it.

Define the flag until drm_mode.h carries it, give
stereo_fb_layout_from_mode() its layout (a 2W x H framebuffer, the left
eye at x 0 and the right eye at x W), and name it "FS" in mode dumps.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 lib/igt_fb.c  | 8 ++++++++
 lib/igt_kms.c | 2 ++
 lib/igt_kms.h | 9 +++++++++
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lib/igt_fb.c b/lib/igt_fb.c
index 6c3b9b0b9..1d386ebf0 100644
--- a/lib/igt_fb.c
+++ b/lib/igt_fb.c
@@ -2531,6 +2531,14 @@ static void stereo_fb_layout_from_mode(struct stereo_fb_layout *layout,
 		box_init(&layout->right,
 			 middle, 0, hdisplay - middle, vdisplay);
 		break;
+	case DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_SEQUENTIAL:
+		/* Both eyes side by side, each the size of the mode, one sent per frame */
+		layout->fb_width = 2 * hdisplay;
+		layout->fb_height = vdisplay;
+
+		box_init(&layout->left, 0, 0, hdisplay, vdisplay);
+		box_init(&layout->right, hdisplay, 0, hdisplay, vdisplay);
+		break;
 	case DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_PACKING:
 	{
 		int vactive_space = mode->vtotal - vdisplay;
diff --git a/lib/igt_kms.c b/lib/igt_kms.c
index e1adf1b6f..188b54729 100644
--- a/lib/igt_kms.c
+++ b/lib/igt_kms.c
@@ -1264,6 +1264,8 @@ static const char *mode_stereo_name(const drmModeModeInfo *mode)
 		return "TB";
 	case DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_SIDE_BY_SIDE_HALF:
 		return "SBSH";
+	case DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_SEQUENTIAL:
+		return "FS";
 	default:
 		return NULL;
 	}
diff --git a/lib/igt_kms.h b/lib/igt_kms.h
index c6081a16a..ab5859a59 100644
--- a/lib/igt_kms.h
+++ b/lib/igt_kms.h
@@ -42,6 +42,15 @@
 #include "igt_fb.h"
 #include "ioctl_wrappers.h"
 
+/*
+ * Frame-sequential stereo: the framebuffer holds both eyes side by side,
+ * left eye first, and the driver sends one eye per frame of the mode. Not
+ * in drm_mode.h yet: proposed with the kernel's frame-sequential series.
+ */
+#ifndef DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_SEQUENTIAL
+#define DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_FRAME_SEQUENTIAL	(9 << 14)
+#endif
+
 /* Low-level helpers with kmstest_ prefix */
 
 /**
